{"job_id":"F-29862f5619068af6e3aa","family_id":"F-29862f5619068af6e3aa","title":"베트남 및 인도산 페로실리코망간에 대한 덤핑방지관세 부과에 관한 규칙","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-014484-252977-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":38,"target_id":"1e856f3c3efa495574e883253e5a9bb3f13649c3b03243bbb1a64d7cb90e719c","source_hash":"60bd718229ac874d002b6208b6b8e0e135a5b68263c547d912f631046ff6871e","text":"关于对来自越南和印度的硅酸锰铁征收反倾销税的规定"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-014484-252977-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":86,"target_id":"0926482fb64dd8a4fcf49fe7cf368df3cba8926104777987e60163164ea2c6a6","source_hash":"1a2180cc6d0a23473176e09b095aee2b985442fe6d501f1561d90af9fc54684e","text":"第一条（目的）本规则的目的是根据《海关法》第五十一条指定应缴纳反倾销税的商品和供应商，并规定适用于该等商品的关税税率。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-014484-252977-ko","scope":"BODY","start":86,"end":211,"target_id":"b94ee706ec3510687024deb08bd709d821a5f8fb708055f6fd75b339017950df","source_hash":"3a3800ab36447113a53680384ef0235978de0b73fe0d1e8087454422aff0e622","text":"第二条（征收反倾销税的货物） 征收反倾销税的货物为越南和印度的硅锰铁（指根据《海关法实施令》第98条第1款规定，海关和统计协调制度税号7202.30.0000对应的货物）。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-014484-252977-ko","scope":"BODY","start":211,"end":286,"target_id":"e6e53bfd3d342b4dbd966fa6c294544b7113b1414947ce732f94d9b74cee182f","source_hash":"2a9a883534d346b34789a4e35bdba50415b359f2b1157b2c69b6940aa7b3ebdb","text":"第三条（受征税货物的供应商和反倾销税税率）根据第二条规定受征税货物的供应商以及各供应商的反倾销税税率如下表所示。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-014484-252977-ko","scope":"BODY","start":286,"end":309,"target_id":"dba57173594829aff25a237de244ba0ea393e6f8c70d54d33bb737f99bfa3cd2","source_hash":"a43c756c7c00b7dfc4db6ff69f0a8c5505d7a567bff0dbf1d1ae450adb955f92","text":"补充规定 <第1007号，2023年7月21日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-014484-252977-ko","scope":"BODY","start":309,"end":339,"target_id":"c3a70aa89ec0d1cc0895640387ede8f38b0f1ff27d9f4783639df2a17dc53151","source_hash":"0d63a18201aaf2f1d98d1a1c71f36ac02913f4fc2004246a24afe6bdd25c6c45","text":"第一条（生效日期）本规则自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00007","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-014484-252977-ko","scope":"BODY","start":339,"end":377,"target_id":"f20033ed88d41255f16d9ca032b0905e57ab870e10fc2f23d91cd28a91f240f9","source_hash":"183d72790e621b013e8abef61a83e88b16c9786072b353343cb89f76f2b1daf3","text":"第二条（有效期）本规则自公布之日起有效期为五年。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00008","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-014484-252977-ko","scope":"BODY","start":377,"end":2116,"target_id":"e3b6e93c4d9206e60f3e6f58448b945814bc508f3e00381541e10bb1350d3881","source_hash":"f3984e003a4238e7b051679c047598004ca01607553802576da85e23c25f2d1b","text":"第 3 条（适用于复审期间受反倾销措施约束的货物）本规则适用于 2022 年 11 月 29 日或之后申报进口的货物。\n\n供应商对受反倾销税征收的货物征收的反倾销税税率（与第3条相关）\n■ 对越南和印度产硅锰铁征收反倾销税的规则 [附表]        \n\n  供应商对受反倾销税征收的货物征收的反倾销税税率（与第3条相关）                                   \n\n┌───┬─────────────────────────────────┬────┐\n\n│供应国│供应商│反倾销│\n\n│ │ │关税 │\n\n│      │                                                                  │(%)     │\n\n├───┼─────────────────────────────────┼────┤\n\n│越南│1. NRM（海阳新资源冶金股份公司）│2.30 │\n\n│ │公司）以及出口该公司产品的人 │ │\n\n│      ├─────────────────────────────────┼────┤\n\n│ │2. 其他供应商 │2.30 │\n\n├───┼─────────────────────────────────┼────┤\n\n│印度 │3. Anjaney（Anjaney Ferro Alloys Limited）及其产品出口 │11.04 │\n\n│ │ 该人 │ │\n\n│      ├─────────────────────────────────┼────┤\n\n│ │4. Maithan Alloys Limited 及其产品出口商 │11.04 │\n\n│      ├─────────────────────────────────┼────┤\n\n│ │5. Indsil Energy（Indsil Energy and Electrochemicals Private Limited）│11.04 │\n\n│ │d) 以及出口公司产品的人员 │ │\n\n│      ├─────────────────────────────────┼────┤\n\n│ │6. Indsil Hydro（Indsil Hydro Power and Manganese Limited）和 │11.04 │\n\n│ │出口该公司产品的人 │ │\n\n│      ├─────────────────────────────────┼────┤\n\n│ │7. Mortex（Mortex集团）及其产品出口商 │11.04 │\n\n│      ├─────────────────────────────────┼────┤\n\n"},{"id":"A39600-zh-00001","doc":"A39600","law_id":"kr-014484-252977-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML